        "body": "Amerisourcebergen Drug has $4.5B in federal contract obligations in FY2026 to date. Amerisourcebergen Drug received 289,045 awards this fiscal year, with an average award size of $15.7K. Amerisourcebergen Drug's obligations fell 38.9% year over year. Recent fiscal comparisons show FY25 at $7.4B and FY24 at $6.1B."
      },
